{"data":[{"author_id":"626660983","created_at":"2026-10-19T12:14:49.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2112155506299253053"],"id":"2112155506299253053","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":8,"impression_count":4474,"like_count":198,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":8,"retweet_count":12},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2112023540698316859","type":"quoted"}],"text":"There is no actual SSA trust fund.\n\nIt went into government spending on goods and services Boomers consumed while they were younger. https://t.co/K3T3E6MrWX","url":"https://x.com/lymanstoneky/status/2112155506299253053"},{"author_id":"626660983","created_at":"2026-10-19T12:14:08.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2112155336832610547"],"id":"2112155336832610547","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":9,"impression_count":5303,"like_count":242,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":10,"retweet_count":6},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2111961391405867409","type":"quoted"}],"text":"Correct. Most people would need to have somewhere between 3 and 5 children in order to ACTUALLY pay their way in retirement. https://t.co/tJwJaGpAdL","url":"https://x.com/lymanstoneky/status/2112155336832610547"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2112153959657820160"]},"author_id":"21436960","created_at":"2026-10-19T12:08:55.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2112154024158101780"],"id":"2112154024158101780","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":55,"impression_count":24306,"like_count":643,"quote_count":8,"reply_count":26,"retweet_count":89},"text":"We're developing a service station for the Moon. 🌕\n\nOASIS will provide power, communications and data services to scientific experiments, helping them survive the two-week lunar night and operate for years on the surface.\n\nRead more: https://t.co/WonN1Rj1jK https://t.co/rGCK5X5ujT","url":"https://x.com/esa/status/2112154024158101780"},{"author_id":"6374602","created_at":"2026-10-19T10:26:14.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2112128181277008280"],"id":"2112128181277008280","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":3,"impression_count":3462,"like_count":48,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":3,"retweet_count":5},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2112111374843170874","type":"quoted"}],"text":"Uzbekistan is the newest Artemis Accords signatory: https://t.co/Xnxc3TLtss","url":"https://x.com/jeff_foust/status/2112128181277008280"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2112096586809372673"]},"author_id":"17217640","created_at":"2026-10-19T08:21:27.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2112096779873190323"],"id":"2112096779873190323","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":3,"impression_count":9591,"like_count":136,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":4,"retweet_count":21},"text":"SpaceX scrubbed the launch attempt of the Bandwagon-5 mission this morning due to bad weather in the recovery zone. It was forecast by the 45th Weather Squadron to be a \"moderate to high\" risk. Teams are now targeting Tuesday, Oct. 20 for the launch from Florida.\n\nBackground: https://t.co/zNbIuZkwz4","url":"https://x.com/SpaceflightNow/status/2112096779873190323"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2112081459943014400"]},"author_id":"34743251","created_at":"2026-10-19T07:27:33.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2112083213124272563"],"id":"2112083213124272563","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":136,"impression_count":906153,"like_count":4531,"quote_count":88,"reply_count":226,"retweet_count":564},"text":"Now targeting no earlier than Tuesday, October 20 for Falcon 9’s launch of the Bandwagon-5 rideshare mission from Florida due to unfavorable recovery weather conditions → https://t.co/2mTwEZE4mX https://t.co/IwEqhJCMVN","url":"https://x.com/SpaceX/status/2112083213124272563"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2111996208709296128"]},"author_id":"17217640","created_at":"2026-10-19T01:42:28.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2111996370219397572"],"id":"2111996370219397572","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":5,"impression_count":11879,"like_count":157,"quote_count":4,"reply_count":2,"retweet_count":19},"text":"On Monday, weather permitting, SpaceX is scheduled to launch the Bandwagon-5 rideshare mission from Cape Canaveral Space Force Station. Liftoff from pad 40 is scheduled during an hour-long window opening at 6:30 am ET (1030 UTC).\n\nRead more: https://t.co/TB6HQIXQZC\n\n📸: SpaceX https://t.co/tDHE1jZ0NZ","url":"https://x.com/SpaceflightNow/status/2111996370219397572"},{"author_id":"626660983","created_at":"2026-10-19T00:00:11.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2111970631927398867"],"id":"2111970631927398867","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":2,"impression_count":2227,"like_count":25,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":2,"retweet_count":0},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2111894493993861536","type":"quoted"}],"text":"Maybe it’s nominal growth as we pre-inflate our way out of the 2032 entitles crunch 🥲🥲 https://t.co/1vTP9YL8h5","url":"https://x.com/lymanstoneky/status/2111970631927398867"},{"author_id":"626660983","created_at":"2026-10-18T23:17:00.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2111959761205829984"],"id":"2111959761205829984","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":54,"impression_count":28679,"like_count":1138,"quote_count":8,"reply_count":20,"retweet_count":52},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2111947606205030893","type":"quoted"}],"text":"For retirees:\n\nIf your children RIGHT NOW are paying enough payroll taxes to cover 100% of your and their other parent’s Social Security and Medicare\n\nThen you did your part paying in!\n\nIf not, you are receiving welfare subsidies.\n\nThat’s the actual math. https://t.co/QyFXpItk8r","url":"https://x.com/lymanstoneky/status/2111959761205829984"},{"author_id":"626660983","created_at":"2026-10-18T23:10:52.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2111958218947637676"],"id":"2111958218947637676","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":107,"impression_count":25065,"like_count":238,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":3,"retweet_count":3},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2111885406564180381","type":"quoted"}],"text":"“Maybe I will just incorporate myself and pay way lower Social Security taxes as I pay myself market standard wages and then take the residual as K1 profits….” I said to myself around age 29 and then went and did https://t.co/3NbJbHa29W","url":"https://x.com/lymanstoneky/status/2111958218947637676"},{"author_id":"626660983","created_at":"2026-10-18T22:08:49.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2111942603486667209"],"id":"2111942603486667209","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":11,"impression_count":21201,"like_count":1327,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":16,"retweet_count":19},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2111930361630326847","type":"quoted"}],"text":"People actually believe this lie https://t.co/phKeeHGR68","url":"https://x.com/lymanstoneky/status/2111942603486667209"},{"author_id":"626660983","created_at":"2026-10-18T22:08:28.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2111942516538818886"],"id":"2111942516538818886","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":5,"impression_count":5915,"like_count":24,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":2,"retweet_count":0},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2111622265284546620","type":"quoted"}],"text":"But of course they will! https://t.co/rItsPNBSVN","url":"https://x.com/lymanstoneky/status/2111942516538818886"},{"author_id":"626660983","created_at":"2026-10-18T19:51:10.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2111907963623604559"],"id":"2111907963623604559","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":21,"impression_count":9330,"like_count":89,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":7,"retweet_count":3},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2111894083530838499","type":"quoted"}],"text":"This graph shows that after age 65 there’s no difference in fiscal contribution between white Americans and Mexican immigrants https://t.co/jVJN0FVrp3","url":"https://x.com/lymanstoneky/status/2111907963623604559"},{"author_id":"626660983","created_at":"2026-10-18T01:17:52.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2111627792517677267"],"id":"2111627792517677267","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":13,"impression_count":7193,"like_count":373,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":2,"retweet_count":24},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2111622370398237023"